/ActualText (  Of course, the solar eclipse on Monday April 8th. We are not in the path of totality, there will be NO TIME during this partial eclipse for you to view the eclipse without eye protection., PLEASE pay close attention to your children as they try to use protective glasses, that they stay on!)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [16 17]
